doc:sch-1-sec-26 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "26 Subparagraph 400.4(1)(b)(i) of the Criminal Code" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Omit “proceeds of crime”, substitute “proceeds of indictable crime”." ;
    cof:pageNumber "22"^^xsd:integer .

concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021-sch-1-sec-27 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "27 After subsection 400.4(1) of the Criminal Code"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-27 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: (1A) A person commits an offence if:  Money laundering  Schedule 1 General amendments  Part 1 No. 3, 2021 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Economic Disruption) Act 2021 (a) the person engages in conduct in relation to money or other property; and (b) the money or property is, and the person believes it to be, proceeds of general crime; and (c) the conduct concealed or disguised any or all of the following: (i) the nature of the money or property; (ii) the value of the money or property; (iii) the source of the money or property; (iv) the location of the money or property; (v) any disposition of the money or property; (vi) any movement of the money or property; (vii) any rights in respect of the money or property; (viii) the identity of any person who has rights in respect of the money or property; (ix) the identity of any person who has effective control of the money or property; and (d) when the conduct occurs, the value of the money and other property is $100,000 or more. Penalty: Imprisonment for 20 years, or 1200 penalty units, or both. (1B) A person commits an offence if: (a) on 2 or more occasions, the person engages in conduct in relation to money or other property; and (b) for each occasion, the money or property is, and the person believes it to be, proceeds of general crime; and (c) for each occasion, the conduct concealed or disguised any or all of the following: (i) the nature of the money or property; (ii) the value of the money or property; (iii) the source of the money or property; (iv) the location of the money or property; (v) any disposition of the money or property; (vi) any movement of the money or property; (vii) any rights in respect of the money or property;  Schedule 1  Money laundering" ;
    skos:definition "Insert: (1A) A person commits an offence if:  Money laundering  Schedule 1 General amendments  Part 1 No. 3, 2021 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Economic Disruption) Act 2021 (a) the person engages in conduct in relation to money or other property; and (b) the money or property is, and the person believes it to be, proceeds of general crime; and (c) the conduct concealed or disguised any or all of the following: (i) the nature of the money or property; (ii) the value of the money or property; (iii) the source of the money or property; (iv) the location of the money or property; (v) any disposition of the money or property; (vi) any movement of the money or property; (vii) any rights in respect of the money or property; (viii) the identity of any person who has rights in respect of the money or property; (ix) the identity of any person who has effective control of the money or property; and (d) when the conduct occurs, the value of the money and other property is $100,000 or more. Penalty: Imprisonment for 20 years, or 1200 penalty units, or both. (1B) A person commits an offence if: (a) on 2 or more occasions, the person engages in conduct in relation to money or other property; and (b) for each occasion, the money or property is, and the person believes it to be, proceeds of general crime; and (c) for each occasion, the conduct concealed or disguised any or all of the following: (i) the nature of the money or property; (ii) the value of the money or property; (iii) the source of the money or property; (iv) the location of the money or property; (v) any disposition of the money or property; (vi) any movement of the money or property; (vii) any rights in respect of the money or property;  Schedule 1  Money laundering"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "8445d5cfe714f4491bdd7be3a32948e53e2a96ef2d6d75ca8d501fbc73a359c4" ;
    cof:pageNumber "22"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021-sch-1-sec-27-ss-1a ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021-sch-1-sec-27-ss-1b ;
