concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021-sch-1-sec-62 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "62 Before subsection 400.9(1) of the Criminal Code"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-62 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: (1AA) A person commits an offence if: (a) the person deals with money or other property; and (b) it is reasonable to suspect that the money or property is proceeds of indictable crime; and (c) at the time of the dealing, the value of the money and other property is $10,000,000 or more. Penalty: Imprisonment for 5 years, or 300 penalty units, or both.  Schedule 1  Money laundering" ;
    skos:definition "Insert: (1AA) A person commits an offence if: (a) the person deals with money or other property; and (b) it is reasonable to suspect that the money or property is proceeds of indictable crime; and (c) at the time of the dealing, the value of the money and other property is $10,000,000 or more. Penalty: Imprisonment for 5 years, or 300 penalty units, or both.  Schedule 1  Money laundering"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "5c33adf749443d5e5ddfec80c74f8fee824706f569777efbebcac8a668fbee63" ;
    cof:pageNumber "29"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Dealing with proceeds of indictable crime over $10,000,000 is an offence." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021.pdf> ;
    dc:source "crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021.pdf, p.29" ;
