concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021-sch-1-sec-65 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "65 Subsection 400.9(2) of the Criminal Code"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-65 ;
    values:originalText "Omit “Without limiting paragraph (1)(b) or (1A)(b), that paragraph is taken to be satisfied if:”, substitute “For the purposes of this section, it is taken to be reasonable to suspect that money or other property is proceeds of indictable crime if:”." ;
    skos:definition "Omit “Without limiting paragraph (1)(b) or (1A)(b), that paragraph is taken to be satisfied if:”, substitute “For the purposes of this section, it is taken to be reasonable to suspect that money or other property is proceeds of indictable crime if:”."@en ;
