concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021-sch-1-sec-79 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "79 After paragraph 400.15(1)(b) of the Criminal Code"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-79 ;
    values:originalText "Insert: (ba) in the case of an alleged offence against a proceeds of general crime offence provision: (i) the conduct constituting the alleged offence occurs wholly outside Australia (but not on board an Australian aircraft or an Australian ship); and  Schedule 1  Money laundering" ;
