concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021-sch-1-sec-400-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "400 10B  Effect of money or property being provided as part of a"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-400-4 ;
    values:originalText "controlled operation—proceeds of general crime (1) In a prosecution for an offence against a proceeds of general crime offence provision by a person in relation to the person engaging in conduct in relation to money or other property, it is not necessary to prove that the money or property is proceeds of general crime if it is proved that, as part of a controlled operation in relation to suspected offences against this Division, either of the following provided the money or property:  Schedule 1  Money laundering" ;
    skos:definition "controlled operation—proceeds of general crime (1) In a prosecution for an offence against a proceeds of general crime offence provision by a person in relation to the person engaging in conduct in relation to money or other property, it is not necessary to prove that the money or property is proceeds of general crime if it is proved that, as part of a controlled operation in relation to suspected offences against this Division, either of the following provided the money or property:  Schedule 1  Money laundering"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b4a25a391ca4f1d1291289a3b0fa8f75b48cfe13a1883738e2bd531aafcb3a28" ;
    cof:pageNumber "35"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Prove that money or property is proceeds of general crime if part of controlled operation in relation to suspected offences against Division." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021.pdf> ;
    dc:source "crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021.pdf, p.35" ;
    cml:asserts concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021-sch-1-sec-400-4-norm .
