    values:originalText "Crime Act 2002 Despite the amendments made by items 2 to 5, the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002 continues to apply, in relation to: (a) an application made before the commencement of this item for an order under section 103 of that Act; and (b) an order made under section 103 of that Act: (i) after the commencement of this item, in response to such an application; or (ii) before the commencement of this item; as if those amendments had not been made.  Benefit  Schedule 4 Amendments  Part 1 No. 3, 2021 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Economic Disruption) Act 2021" ;
