concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021-sch-5-sec-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "6 Application"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-5-sec-6 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Subject to subitem (2), the amendments made by this Schedule, to the extent that they are relevant to property acquired by a person, apply in relation to property acquired by the person before, at or after the commencement of this item. (2) The amendments made by this Schedule, to the extent that they are relevant to proceedings in a court, apply in relation to: (a) proceedings instituted after the commencement of this item; and (b) proceedings that: (i) were instituted before the commencement of this item; and (ii) are pending as at the commencement of this item.  Information  Schedule 6 Amendments  Part 1 No. 3, 2021 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Economic Disruption) Act 2021" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Subject to subitem (2), the amendments made by this Schedule, to the extent that they are relevant to property acquired by a person, apply in relation to property acquired by the person before, at or after the commencement of this item. (2) The amendments made by this Schedule, to the extent that they are relevant to proceedings in a court, apply in relation to: (a) proceedings instituted after the commencement of this item; and (b) proceedings that: (i) were instituted before the commencement of this item; and (ii) are pending as at the commencement of this item.  Information  Schedule 6 Amendments  Part 1 No. 3, 2021 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Economic Disruption) Act 2021"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "6410165eeb6138c7e94cf7d228b737ceb900ffd2d378452c5afb0b04bb77ef1a" ;
    cof:pageNumber "56"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Application of amendments made by this Schedule to property acquired before, at or after commencement." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021.pdf> ;
    dc:source "crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021.pdf, p.56" ;
    cml:asserts concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021-sch-5-sec-6-norm .
