concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021-sch-6-sec-19 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "19 Section 338 (after paragraph (g) of the definition of"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-6-sec-19 ;
    values:originalText "serious offence) Insert: (ga) an offence against section 195, 196 or 197A that relates to an *examination of a person who is the subject of an *examination order under section 180, if the person committing the offence: (i) is covered by paragraph 180(1)(a) or (b); or (ii) is or was a party to proceedings relating to the *restraining order mentioned in section 180; or (gb) an offence against section 195, 196 or 197A that relates to an examination of a person who is the subject of an examination order under section 180A, if the person committing the offence: (i) is covered by paragraph 180A(1)(a); or  Schedule 6  Information" ;
    skos:definition "serious offence) Insert: (ga) an offence against section 195, 196 or 197A that relates to an *examination of a person who is the subject of an *examination order under section 180, if the person committing the offence: (i) is covered by paragraph 180(1)(a) or (b); or (ii) is or was a party to proceedings relating to the *restraining order mentioned in section 180; or (gb) an offence against section 195, 196 or 197A that relates to an examination of a person who is the subject of an examination order under section 180A, if the person committing the offence: (i) is covered by paragraph 180A(1)(a); or  Schedule 6  Information"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "97b87a408d934ac299f93fa9ad08d416cca932eac8b9f070a4a1ad4a41f149bd" ;
    cof:pageNumber "61"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Offence against section 195, 196 or 197A related to examination of person under section 180" ;
