    values:originalText "(2) If a person served with notice under paragraph (1)(d) in relation to the other interest mentioned in that paragraph lodges a written objection to the purchase of that other interest with the Minister and the *Official Trustee within the period referred to in that paragraph: (a) the Minister; or (b) a *senior Departmental officer authorised by the Minister for the purposes of this subsection; may direct the Official Trustee to transfer that other interest to the person." ;
    cof:pageNumber "66"^^xsd:integer .

