    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed .

concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021-sch-7-sec-106 cml:asserts concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021-sch-7-sec-106-logic-alleninterval-2 .
