concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021-sch-7-sec-267aa a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "267AA Additional property to which the Official Trustee’s powers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-7-sec-267aa ;
    values:originalText "under Division 2 apply (1) The powers conferred on the *Official Trustee under Division 2 may be exercised in relation to: (a) property that is the subject of a *forfeiture order; or (b) property forfeited under section 92; or  Official Trustee  Schedule 7 General amendments  Part 1 No. 3, 2021 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Economic Disruption) Act 2021 (c) property that is subject to a direction under section 282 or 282A. (2) Without limiting the definition of controlled property in section 267, for the purposes of Division 2, that property is controlled property." ;
    skos:definition "under Division 2 apply (1) The powers conferred on the *Official Trustee under Division 2 may be exercised in relation to: (a) property that is the subject of a *forfeiture order; or (b) property forfeited under section 92; or  Official Trustee  Schedule 7 General amendments  Part 1 No. 3, 2021 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Economic Disruption) Act 2021 (c) property that is subject to a direction under section 282 or 282A. (2) Without limiting the definition of controlled property in section 267, for the purposes of Division 2, that property is controlled property."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7cd97c2a5d7d2c8dea25634fa8714440ec3821dcdea3f06902844ba576f29075" ;
    cof:pageNumber "70"^^xsd:integer ;
