concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021-sch-7-sec-267ab-ss-1 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "267AB(1) Additional property to which the Official Trustee’s powers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-7-sec-267ab-ss-1 ;
    values:originalText "(1) The powers conferred on the *Official Trustee under Division 3 may be exercised, and the duties imposed on the Official Trustee under Division 3 are to be performed, in relation to: (a) property that is the subject of a *forfeiture order; or (b) property forfeited under section 92; or (c) property that is subject to a direction under section 282 or 282A." ;
    skos:definition "(1) The powers conferred on the *Official Trustee under Division 3 may be exercised, and the duties imposed on the Official Trustee under Division 3 are to be performed, in relation to: (a) property that is the subject of a *forfeiture order; or (b) property forfeited under section 92; or (c) property that is subject to a direction under section 282 or 282A."@en ;
