    skos:prefLabel "267AB(4) Additional property to which the Official Trustee’s powers"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-7-sec-267ab-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) If property is subject to a direction under section 282 or 282A, the powers conferred on the *Official Trustee under Division 3 may be exercised, and the duties imposed on the Official Trustee under Division 3 are to be performed, in relation to the property during the appeal period under section 285.  Schedule 7  Official Trustee" ;
