concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021-sch-7-sec-275a a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "275A Failure to produce a book"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-7-sec-275a ;
    values:originalText "A person commits an offence if: (a) the person is required by a notice under paragraph 270(1)(e) to produce a *book; and (b) the person refuses or fails to comply with the notice. Penalty: Imprisonment for 6 months or 30 penalty units, or both." ;
    skos:definition "A person commits an offence if: (a) the person is required by a notice under paragraph 270(1)(e) to produce a *book; and (b) the person refuses or fails to comply with the notice. Penalty: Imprisonment for 6 months or 30 penalty units, or both."@en ;
