    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-7-sec-45 ;
    values:originalText "Omit “the *restraining order relating to the *controlled property ceases to be in force and the property is returned to its owner,”, substitute “the *controlled property is returned to its owner as a result of a restraining order ceasing to be in force or as a result of the controlled property ceasing to be subject to forfeiture under this Act,”." ;
