concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021-sch-7-sec-298b a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "298B Terms and conditions of grants"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-7-sec-298b ;
    values:originalText "Scope (1) This section applies to a grant of financial assistance made under section 298A. Terms and conditions (2) The terms and conditions on which that financial assistance is granted must be set out in a written agreement between the Commonwealth and the grant recipient. (3) The grant recipient must comply with the terms and conditions. (4) Without limiting subsection (2), the terms and conditions must provide for the circumstances in which the grant recipient must repay amounts to the Commonwealth. Note: An amount repayable to the Commonwealth would be a debt due to the Commonwealth.  Official Trustee  Schedule 7 General amendments  Part 1 No. 3, 2021 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Economic Disruption) Act 2021 (5) An agreement under subsection (2) is to be entered into by the Minister on behalf of the Commonwealth." ;
    skos:definition "Scope (1) This section applies to a grant of financial assistance made under section 298A. Terms and conditions (2) The terms and conditions on which that financial assistance is granted must be set out in a written agreement between the Commonwealth and the grant recipient. (3) The grant recipient must comply with the terms and conditions. (4) Without limiting subsection (2), the terms and conditions must provide for the circumstances in which the grant recipient must repay amounts to the Commonwealth. Note: An amount repayable to the Commonwealth would be a debt due to the Commonwealth.  Official Trustee  Schedule 7 General amendments  Part 1 No. 3, 2021 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Economic Disruption) Act 2021 (5) An agreement under subsection (2) is to be entered into by the Minister on behalf of the Commonwealth."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "b073f6c68ef8721107fd9815b19b2c35ec111d526b75c2123d1111ba64424000" ;
    cof:pageNumber "80"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021-sch-7-sec-298b-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021-sch-7-sec-298b-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021-sch-7-sec-298b-ss-3 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021-sch-7-sec-298b-ss-4 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021-sch-7-sec-298b-ss-5 ;
