    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(3) The grant recipient must comply with the terms and conditions." ;
    cof:pageNumber "80"^^xsd:integer .

concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021-sch-7-sec-298b-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "298B(4) Terms and conditions of grants"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-7-sec-298b-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) Without limiting subsection (2), the terms and conditions must provide for the circumstances in which the grant recipient must repay amounts to the Commonwealth. Note: An amount repayable to the Commonwealth would be a debt due to the Commonwealth.  Official Trustee  Schedule 7 General amendments  Part 1 No. 3, 2021 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Economic Disruption) Act 2021" ;
    skos:definition "(4) Without limiting subsection (2), the terms and conditions must provide for the circumstances in which the grant recipient must repay amounts to the Commonwealth. Note: An amount repayable to the Commonwealth would be a debt due to the Commonwealth.  Official Trustee  Schedule 7 General amendments  Part 1 No. 3, 2021 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Economic Disruption) Act 2021"@en ;
