concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021-sch-7-sec-298e a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "298E Channelling State/Territory grants through the COAG"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-7-sec-298e ;
    values:originalText "Reform Fund (1) If the Minister decides that a grant of financial assistance should be made to a State or Territory under section 298A, the Minister must, by writing, direct that, as soon as practicable, a specified amount (which must equal the amount of the grant) is to be: (a) debited from the *Confiscated Assets Account; and (b) credited to the *COAG Reform Fund. (2) The direction must be expressed to be given in order to enable the amount to be debited from the *COAG Reform Fund for the purpose of making the grant. (3) Two or more directions under subsection (1) may be set out in the same document.  Schedule 7  Official Trustee" ;
    skos:definition "Reform Fund (1) If the Minister decides that a grant of financial assistance should be made to a State or Territory under section 298A, the Minister must, by writing, direct that, as soon as practicable, a specified amount (which must equal the amount of the grant) is to be: (a) debited from the *Confiscated Assets Account; and (b) credited to the *COAG Reform Fund. (2) The direction must be expressed to be given in order to enable the amount to be debited from the *COAG Reform Fund for the purpose of making the grant. (3) Two or more directions under subsection (1) may be set out in the same document.  Schedule 7  Official Trustee"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "7833ecbb68fa5f8eb86eedc6ef48170b68845e4c6fadc99f3237d5cc7e22c10b" ;
    cof:pageNumber "81"^^xsd:integer ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021-sch-7-sec-298e-ss-1 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021-sch-7-sec-298e-ss-2 ;
    cml:hasPart concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021-sch-7-sec-298e-ss-3 ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
