    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-7-sec-298e-ss-1 ;
    values:originalText "(1) If the Minister decides that a grant of financial assistance should be made to a State or Territory under section 298A, the Minister must, by writing, direct that, as soon as practicable, a specified amount (which must equal the amount of the grant) is to be: (a) debited from the *Confiscated Assets Account; and (b) credited to the *COAG Reform Fund." ;
    skos:definition "(1) If the Minister decides that a grant of financial assistance should be made to a State or Territory under section 298A, the Minister must, by writing, direct that, as soon as practicable, a specified amount (which must equal the amount of the grant) is to be: (a) debited from the *Confiscated Assets Account; and (b) credited to the *COAG Reform Fund."@en ;
