doc:sch-7-sec-65 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "65 Application—paragraph 297(e) of the Proceeds of Crime" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "Act 2002 (1) The amendment of paragraph 297(e) of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002 made by this Part, so far as it concerns amounts payable to the Official Trustee under regulations made for the purposes of paragraph 288(1)(a) of that Act, applies in relation to costs, charges and expenses incurred after the commencement of this item. (2) The amendment of paragraph 297(e) of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002 made by this Part, so far as it concerns amounts payable to the Official Trustee under regulations made for the purposes of paragraph 288(1)(b) of that Act, applies in relation to remuneration that becomes payable after the commencement of this item." ;
    cof:pageNumber "84"^^xsd:integer .

concept:crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021-sch-7-sec-66 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "66 Application—paragraph 297(ea) of the Proceeds of Crime"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-7-sec-66 ;
    values:originalText "Act 2002 (1) Paragraph 297(ea) of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002 (as amended by this Part), so far as it concerns amounts payable to the Official Trustee under regulations made for the purposes of paragraph 9B(1)(a) of the Crimes Act 1914, applies in relation to costs, charges and expenses incurred after the commencement of this item. (2) Paragraph 297(ea) of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002 (as amended by this Part), so far as it concerns amounts payable to the Official Trustee under regulations made for the purposes of paragraph 9B(1)(b) of the Crimes Act 1914, applies in relation to remuneration that becomes payable after the commencement of this item.  Official Trustee  Schedule 7 Amendments contingent on the commencement of the Crimes Legislation Amendment (Combatting Corporate Crime) Act 2021  Part 2 No. 3, 2021 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Economic Disruption) Act 2021" ;
    skos:definition "Act 2002 (1) Paragraph 297(ea) of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002 (as amended by this Part), so far as it concerns amounts payable to the Official Trustee under regulations made for the purposes of paragraph 9B(1)(a) of the Crimes Act 1914, applies in relation to costs, charges and expenses incurred after the commencement of this item. (2) Paragraph 297(ea) of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002 (as amended by this Part), so far as it concerns amounts payable to the Official Trustee under regulations made for the purposes of paragraph 9B(1)(b) of the Crimes Act 1914, applies in relation to remuneration that becomes payable after the commencement of this item.  Official Trustee  Schedule 7 Amendments contingent on the commencement of the Crimes Legislation Amendment (Combatting Corporate Crime) Act 2021  Part 2 No. 3, 2021 Crimes Legislation Amendment (Economic Disruption) Act 2021"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "35b11be2e4a00f2da5654015687777a6799bb9eb4ffe01966af2013220c1e2bb" ;
    cof:pageNumber "84"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Application of paragraph 297(ea) of the Proceeds of Crime Act 2002 to costs, charges and expenses incurred after commencement." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021.pdf> ;
    dc:source "crimes-legislation-amendment-economic-disruption-act-2021.pdf, p.84" ;
